# Project 4R — local.properties example
#
# Since v1.1 this project needs NO API keys.
# All live data comes from keyless public APIs:
#   - Flights   : your Vercel backend (SerpAPI key lives in Vercel env, not here)
#   - Currency  : https://open.er-api.com        (keyless)
#   - Holidays  : https://caldays.com            (keyless, CC BY 4.0)
#   - Weather   : https://api.open-meteo.com     (keyless)
#
# Android Studio will create local.properties with just sdk.dir:
sdk.dir=/path/to/your/Android/Sdk
